    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furry\u00a0Company\u00a0-\u00a0relaxing simulation game (Free Demo during Steam Next Fest!)\u00a0If you like it, don\u2019t forget to add it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/1eed8530f3af4b83ebfe04d94fb1c50d.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanna know about our development progress or future updates? Join our community and chat with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furry Company is a relaxing simulation game sits at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other task while letting adorable animals work for you and build your dream company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/fba01aff3632dfc0e52350e5e9b3e72e.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bThe game offers diverse range of themed scenes\u00a0(Basic Style, Magical Castle, Space Design, or Toy Town.)\u00a0and\u00a0over 100+\u00a0furniture to match.\u00a0You can\u00a0Unleash your creativity and design your ideal workspace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/c6929c44810d8c81974e9b3b00603d08.poster.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/c6929c44810d8c81974e9b3b00603d08.webm?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/c6929c44810d8c81974e9b3b00603d08.mp4?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/758c99a13297fc44ee6dfbd5990e47b8.avif?t=1754041197\" data-has-big width=800 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/e408e5f2c37ee101890bec1255bba15c.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a wide variety of adorable animals (only a few designs are shown here), each with unique appearances, colors, and outfits. Can you recognize all your employees?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More\u00a0mystery\u00a0animals are waiting to make their debut!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/225774f7d249d6bbfc9e7c0f4bc5b884.poster.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/225774f7d249d6bbfc9e7c0f4bc5b884.webm?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/225774f7d249d6bbfc9e7c0f4bc5b884.mp4?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/1020c1bb910a2df4144884f288dc2c0e.avif?t=1754041197\" width=730 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/ad85c815b6eb778a20668f31f135af0e.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your animal employees have various behaviors that require your attention! When they act strangely, make sure to address their needs. Keep them happy with ice cream bribes \u2013 productivity meets hilarity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/02262fa5b0c936c78a8fc12c91bc27b9.poster.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/02262fa5b0c936c78a8fc12c91bc27b9.webm?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/02262fa5b0c936c78a8fc12c91bc27b9.mp4?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every piece of furniture you buy for the office unlocks new interactions for your animal employees. The more variety you add, the richer their behaviors become! Plus, you can click on these cute furniture items with your mouse to interact with them yourself!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/4318aff7af781d0aba4bdbc7d2e253e7.poster.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/4318aff7af781d0aba4bdbc7d2e253e7.webm?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/4318aff7af781d0aba4bdbc7d2e253e7.mp4?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/4d79f317c5069f459536a1b5778d60c1.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Key Mode: One-click minimize to &quot;spreadsheet&quot; camouflage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/42c7caf6fa9083808eff6bc47a4d47f5.poster.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/42c7caf6fa9083808eff6bc47a4d47f5.webm?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/42c7caf6fa9083808eff6bc47a4d47f5.mp4?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Pocket Mode: Shrink your company into a taskbar pet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/ac17ede8b3cdeec50b32d9254599323a.poster.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/ac17ede8b3cdeec50b32d9254599323a.webm?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/ac17ede8b3cdeec50b32d9254599323a.mp4?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Custom Window: Disguise as a &quot;productivity widget&quot; (we won't tell)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/b2956dcf0712cd363249a56b708b9e78.poster.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/b2956dcf0712cd363249a56b708b9e78.webm?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/b2956dcf0712cd363249a56b708b9e78.mp4?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furry\u00a0Company\u00a0-\u00a0relaxing simulation game (Free Demo during Steam Next Fest!)\u00a0If you like it, don\u2019t forget to add it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/1eed8530f3af4b83ebfe04d94fb1c50d.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanna know about our development progress or future updates? Join our community and chat with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furry Company is a relaxing simulation game sits at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other task while letting adorable animals work for you and build your dream company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/fba01aff3632dfc0e52350e5e9b3e72e.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bThe game offers diverse range of themed scenes\u00a0(Basic Style, Magical Castle, Space Design, or Toy Town.)\u00a0and\u00a0over 100+\u00a0furniture to match.\u00a0You can\u00a0Unleash your creativity and design your ideal workspace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/c6929c44810d8c81974e9b3b00603d08.poster.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/c6929c44810d8c81974e9b3b00603d08.webm?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/c6929c44810d8c81974e9b3b00603d08.mp4?