85c815b6eb778a20668f31f135af0e.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your animal employees have various behaviors that require your attention! When they act strangely, make sure to address their needs. Keep them happy with ice cream bribes \u2013 productivity meets hilarity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/02262fa5b0c936c78a8fc12c91bc27b9.poster.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/02262fa5b0c936c78a8fc12c91bc27b9.webm?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/02262fa5b0c936c78a8fc12c91bc27b9.mp4?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every piece of furniture you buy for the office unlocks new interactions for your animal employees. The more variety you add, the richer their behaviors become! Plus, you can click on these cute furniture items with your mouse to interact with them yourself!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/4318aff7af781d0aba4bdbc7d2e253e7.poster.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/4318aff7af781d0aba4bdbc7d2e253e7.webm?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/4318aff7af781d0aba4bdbc7d2e253e7.mp4?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/4d79f317c5069f459536a1b5778d60c1.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Key Mode: One-click minimize to &quot;spreadsheet&quot; camouflage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/42c7caf6fa9083808eff6bc47a4d47f5.poster.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/42c7caf6fa9083808eff6bc47a4d47f5.webm?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/42c7caf6fa9083808eff6bc47a4d47f5.mp4?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Pocket Mode: Shrink your company into a taskbar pet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/ac17ede8b3cdeec50b32d9254599323a.poster.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/ac17ede8b3cdeec50b32d9254599323a.webm?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/ac17ede8b3cdeec50b32d9254599323a.mp4?t=1754041197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Custom Window: Disguise as a &quot;productivity widget&quot; (we won't tell)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557690/extras/b2956dcf0712cd363249a56b708b9e78.poster.avif?t=1754041197\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=